  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive. The transitive counterpart is ⟦{合|あ}わせる→合わせる：01872_awaseru⟧ (to combine, to put together).\n\nGodan verb ({五段動詞|ごだんどうし}), る-ending (godan, not ichidan).\n- Negative: {合|あ}わさらない\n- Polite: {合|あ}わさります\n- Te-form: {合|あ}わさって\n- Past: {合|あ}わさった\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{力|ちから}→力：01661_chikara⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{合|あ}わさる: for forces/efforts to combine\n- ⟦{条件|じょうけん}→条件：03285_jouken⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{合|あ}わさる: for conditions to align\n- ⟦{要素|ようそ}→要素：03661_youso⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{合|あ}わさる: for elements to come together",
